      "content": "That's a good start, very professional. But I think we need to be a bit more specific to really drive the point home for the council. When we talk about \"challenges regarding standardized service delivery\" or \"systemic stability,\" we are really hinting at the issues with the current population density and the types of social dynamics we see on the ground. \n\nCould you expand on that section? I want to describe the \"atmosphere\" of the streets more vividly—specifically how the current social makeup and the high level of informal street activity might be perceived as a risk factor for potential investors. Maybe use some more descriptive language regarding the \"unpredictability\" or the \"lack of professionalized environment\" in the current district to show why a more curated, upscale demographic is necessary for the area's future.",
